Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">红果短剧下架AI剧《桃花簪》:出品方涉“盗脸”侵权被停职</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google正式开源Gemma 4模型系列，采用Apache 2.0协议并支持端侧部署</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Cursor 3正式发布：引入智能体统一工作区并支持本地与云端无缝切换</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里通义实验室发布Wan2.7-Video视频生成模型及创作工具</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1c3b901abb4903f434ab5254da4c224f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里通义实验室正式发布Wan2.7-Video视频生成模型及配套创作工具，旨在解决AI视频生成领域的内容专业性不足与修改困难问题。该模型支持文本、图像、视频和音频全模态输入，赋予用户对画面结构、剧情走向及局部细节的精确控制能力。在编辑功能上，Wan2.7-Video支持通过指令实现元素精准调整，包括路人删除、物体替换、背景环境转换及风格一键切换。针对剧情创作，用户无需重新拍摄，即可通过指令修改角色台词、动作及镜头角度。此外，该工具还具备创意快速复刻与剧情延续功能，通过精准的时序控制实现视频无缝衔接。Wan2.7-Video的推出显著提升了视频创作的灵活性与便捷性，为创作者提供了类似文档编辑的视频修改体验，大幅降低了专业视频内容的制作门槛。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美团发布原生多模态大模型LongCat-Next并开源核心架构</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ea451ea1cc00b712c9a5a1ef514b4363.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美团技术团队正式发布并开源原生多模态大模型LongCat-Next，该模型摒弃了“语言基座+插件”的拼凑架构，通过自研DiNA（离散原生自回归）架构，实现图像、语音与文本的底层统一。LongCat-Next将多模态数据转化为同源离散Token，使模型能以统一参数、注意力机制和损失函数处理不同模态。关键技术包括dNaViT视觉分词器，支持任意分辨率输入，通过8层残差向量量化实现28倍像素空间压缩，在保留OCR及财报解析细节的同时显著提升效率。实证性能方面，该模型在OmniDocBench密集文本测试中超越Qwen3-Omni及Qwen3-VL，MathVista视觉推理得分达83.1，C-Eval语言能力得分86.80。LongCat-Next的开源为开发者提供了构建感知物理世界AI的工具，证明了离散化建模在跨模</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">红果短剧下架AI剧《桃花簪》:出品方涉“盗脸”侵权被停职</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c7e011b680f340b284649eccadfdf7d9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">红果短剧下架AI剧《桃花簪》:出品方涉“盗脸”侵权被停职AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Apr 3, 2026584月3日，短剧平台红果短剧正式发布公告，宣布全面下架AI短剧《桃花簪》并对出品方处以暂停上传剧集15天的处罚。此次下架源于多位博主投诉该剧在制作过程中未经授权擅自使用其面部形象进行AI处理，且涉及丑化角色。在平台给出的72小时审核期内，出品方因无法证明素材使用的合规性，被判定违反内容合规规定。该事件始于3月31日，“AI短剧偷脸”话题引发社会广泛讨论。受害者包括汉服博主“白菜”及商业模特“七海”，两人均指出其个人妆造及面部特征被AI高度还原并植入剧集。此案再次推向了生成式AI技术在影视创作中肖像权认定的法律边界。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google正式开源Gemma 4模型系列，采用Apache 2.0协议并支持端侧部署</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f26fdc3cf88181acfdb0f18036c08096.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind正式发布新一代开源模型系列Gemma 4，并全面转向Apache 2.0协议，支持商用与二次开发。该系列包含四款模型：旗舰版31B Dense支持256K上下文，单张H100即可运行；26B A4B MoE采用混合专家架构，激活参数仅3.8B；E4B与E2B则专为手机及嵌入式设备优化，E2B内存占用可压至1.5GB以下。性能方面，Gemma 4在数学竞赛AIME 2026测试中得分达89.2%，Codeforces ELO评分升至2150。功能上，全系内置可开关的“思考模式”，支持原生Agent开发、函数调用及结构化JSON输出，并具备深度多模态能力，支持图像、视频及音频输入。此次发布标志着Google通过极致的端侧工程化与更开放的协议，重新强化其在开源AI领域的竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Cursor 3正式发布：引入智能体统一工作区并支持本地与云端无缝切换</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/406b78eec862fc61ca34a2776c0327d4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Cursor团队正式发布Cursor 3版本，标志着软件开发从“人机协作”向“智能体自主工作”转型。核心创新在于“智能体统一工作区”，允许用户在侧边栏集中管理本地及云端智能体，并支持从移动端、Web、桌面及Slack等多终端启动。新版本实现本地与云端智能体会话的无缝切换，确保长时间任务在离线状态下仍可执行。针对代码审查，Cursor 3引入了更简洁的差异视图UI，提升了变更编辑与协作效率。该版本继续保持对LSP（语言服务器协议）、内置浏览器及插件生态的完整支持。用户现可通过升级Cursor并输入Cmd+Shift+P调出Agents Window体验新功能。Cursor团队表示，此举旨在构建更自主的智能体，推动代码库实现自我驱动，未来将持续优化IDE交互模式以提升开发效率。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
